^TIU(8925,9,"TEXT",11,0)="Joints: Mild synovitis bilateral MCPs 2-3. No PIP swelling today."
^TIU(8925,9,"TEXT",12,0)="Wrists: Full ROM. No effusion."
^TIU(8925,9,"TEXT",13,0)="Knees: No effusion. Full ROM."
