^TIU(8925,34,"TEXT",18,0)="1. T2DM: A1C improving but not at goal. Increase metformin to 1000mg BID."
^TIU(8925,34,"TEXT",19,0)="2. Consider adding GLP-1 agonist if A1C not <7.5% in 3 months."
